139
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:20,680
How naive !

140
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:26,240
No one can oppose a god.

141
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:30,640
And now,

142
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:33,080
