182
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:54,920
Ancient Gods refine their bodies.

183
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:59,400
Cultivation only involves the Divine Sense and the body.

184
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:01,520
Every Ancient God

185
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:04,440
