186
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:06,640
to strengthen their body.

187
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:11,040
When the body reaches the limit of how much spiritual energy it can hold,

188
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:14,800
it will undergo a reconstruction

189
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:17,120
to make the body bigger.

190
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:19,640
This is a process

191
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:21,480
of qualitative change.

192
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:24,240
The more reconstructions there are,

193
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:26,880
the stronger the cultivation.

194
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:30,520
The memory inheritance you absorbed

195
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:33,600
contains the memories of my entire life.

196
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:37,360
I went through 8 reconstructions.

197
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:38,960
And you

198
00:14:39,280 --> 00:14:41,400
