203
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:54,840
Take them.

204
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,280
How far you can go

205
00:14:58,040 --> 00:14:59,760
in the rest of your journey

206
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:02,400
will depend on yourself.

207
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:24,280
200 years later

208
00:15:57,280 --> 00:15:58,680
I never thought that

209
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:01,200
I would see myself in this body once again.

210
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:05,520
I have placed the location

211
00:16:06,160 --> 00:16:09,480
of the Void Ink Stones in your memories.

212
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:11,560
Take them.

213
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:55,520
Open !

214
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:02,360
I want your body,

215
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,560
dead man.

216
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:04,920
Divine Sense,

217
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:06,040
return !

218
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:07,320
This time,

219
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:08,960
no one can stop me !

220
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,600
Be it his talent or Spirit Root, Ma Liang's body

221
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,840
is far superior to my previous body.

222
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,680
Congratulations on your new life.

223
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,400
Underworld Ice Flame,

224
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:38,200
appear !

225
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:00,160
Land of the Ancient God,

226
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:01,840
farewell.

227
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:22,600
Stop torturing me !

228
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,240
I'll talk !

229
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:25,680
I'll talk !

230
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:28,360
Tu Si's memory inheritance

231
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:31,960
