247
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:33,500
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

248
00:19:31,260 --> 00:19:33,500
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

249
00:19:33,820 --> 00:19:36,900
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

250
00:19:37,260 --> 00:19:42,900
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

251
00:19:39,980 --> 00:19:42,900
out of reach.

252
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:48,380
Immortals

253
00:19:45,300 --> 00:19:48,380
