263
00:20:15,940 --> 00:20:23,380
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

264
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:23,380
I can still see.

265
00:20:23,780 --> 00:20:32,740
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

266
00:20:27,740 --> 00:20:32,740
