267
00:20:48,180 --> 00:20:54,140
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

268
00:20:50,900 --> 00:20:54,140
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

269
00:20:54,140 --> 00:21:01,700
With a flick of a finger,

270
00:20:55,580 --> 00:21:01,700
